' UC-002: FR-016, FR-021              UC-006: FR-022
' UC-003: FR-014                      UC-007: FR-012, FR-017, FR-020, FR-022
' UC-004: FR-002, FR-010, FR-011, FR-015, FR-019, FR-021, FR-023
' Transversales: FR-003 (IaC), FR-004 a FR-009 (documentación y flujo), NFR-005 a NFR-014
